## Phases (from catalog/types.yaml; `konstant task gate` prints the same list for a run)

{{phases}}

Each phase is one run of the named agent (Claude Code: `.claude/agents/<agent>.md`; any harness:
`bin/konstant task run` composes it into the phase prompt); a phase agent is a leaf and
never spawns agents. A verifying phase writes its own verdict file in OUT and pins it with the
judge command; nobody else writes or edits it. FAIL, FIX or RECONSIDER re-runs the producer and then
the verifiers into new cycle files (`-c2`, `-c3`) up to the cycle cap. The run is done when
`konstant task check <run>` exits 0.

